## Findings applied to the project

The implemented storefront addresses the most important gaps found in the earlier
MVP. It now presents product variants and live stock together, disables unavailable
options, gives customers a persistent shopping bag after sign-in, calculates
shipping before order confirmation, provides delivery and returns guidance and
includes order history and tracking. The admin portal updates the same catalogue,
stock and fulfilment data used by the customer experience.

The screenshots are direct captures of the public Cotton On, Kmart and ASOS pages
